{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":5,"ref":"2-chronicles 18:5","book":"2-chronicles","lang":"fr","chapter":18,"translation":"Et le roi d'Israël rassembla ⟨את⟩ les prophètes, quatre cents hommes, et il leur dit : Monterons-nous vers Ramoth-Guiléad pour la guerre, ou m'arrêterai-je ? Et ils dirent : Monte, et Élohim donnera ⟨il⟩ en la main du roi.","tokens":[{"surface":"ויקבץ","gloss":"Et rassembla"},{"surface":"מלך","gloss":"le roi"},{"surface":"ישראל","gloss":"d'Israël"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"les prophètes"},{"surface":"הנבאים","gloss":"les prophètes"},{"surface":"ארבע","gloss":"quatre"},{"surface":"מאות","gloss":"cents"},{"surface":"איש","gloss":"hommes"},{"surface":"ויאמר","gloss":"et il dit"},{"surface":"אלהם","gloss":"à eux"},{"surface":"הנלך","gloss":"Monterons-nous"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"vers"},{"surface":"רמת","gloss":"Ramoth"},{"surface":"גלעד","gloss":"Guiléad"},{"surface":"למלחמה","gloss":"pour la guerre"},{"surface":"אם","gloss":"ou"},{"surface":"אחדל","gloss":"m'arrêterai-je"},{"surface":"ויאמרו","gloss":"et ils dirent"},{"surface":"עלה","gloss":"Monte"},{"surface":"ויתן","gloss":"et il donnera"},{"surface":"האלהים","gloss":"Élohim"},{"surface":"ביד","gloss":"en la main"},{"surface":"המלך","gloss":"du roi"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-05T06:07:05.621042642Z","model":"glm-5.2"}